```

## Key Hyperparameters

| Parameter | Default | Description |
|-----------|---------|-------------|
| `hidden_dim` | 512 | Hidden dimension (d) |
| `num_eigenstates` | 64 | Number of eigenmodes (K) |
| `num_layers` | 6 | Number of TEN layers |
| `eigenvalue_constraint` | "sigmoid" | Ensures |λ| ≤ 1 for stability |
| `use_resonance` | True | Enable resonance coupling (Eq. 3) |
| `use_parallel_scan` | True | Parallel scan for O(log T) training |

## Theoretical Guarantees

**Theorem 4 (Lyapunov Stability):** When |λ_k| ≤ 1, the energy E(t) = Σ|c_k(t)|² has bounded growth.

**Proposition 5 (Gradient Flow):** Gradients remain bounded: ||∂L/∂c_k(t)|| ≤ O(1/√T).

